```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Phaser (MainScene)
    participant B as GameBridge
    participant C as colyseus.js
    participant S as MapRoom (Ubuntu)
    participant LK as LiveKit Manager

    Note over P,S: Normal movement loop

    P->>P: Player presses key (WASD/arrow)
    P->>P: Apply velocity immediately (client-side prediction)
    P->>B: emitInput({ left, right, up, down })
    B->>C: input listener fires
    C->>S: room.send("input", { left, right, up, down })

    Note over S: Server simulates authoritative position
    S-->>C: onStateChange(players[])
    C->>B: applyServerState(players)
    B->>P: registerStateApplier callback

    alt drift > 50px
        P->>P: SNAP to server position
    else drift > 5px
        P->>P: LERP 30% toward server position
    else drift ≤ 5px
        P->>P: Trust client prediction (no correction)
    end

    Note over P,LK: Proximity detection

    P->>P: checkProximity() every frame
    P->>B: emitProximityStart(targetId)
    B->>LK: onProximityStart listener (debounced 800ms)

    alt proximity confirmed (800ms debounce passes)
        LK->>S: POST /livekit/token { targetSessionId }
        S-->>LK: { token: "eyJ..." }
        LK->>LK: Room.connect(LIVEKIT_URL, token)
        LK->>LK: Publish cam + mic
    end

    P->>B: emitProximityEnd(targetId)
    B->>LK: onProximityEnd listener (debounced 800ms)

    alt separation confirmed (800ms debounce passes)
        LK->>LK: Room.disconnect()
        LK->>LK: Stop local tracks, clear video elements
    end
```
